---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — a little unsaid.">
  <main class="column page">
    <p class="label">About</p>
    <h1>Hi. I'm the person behind <em>a little unsaid.</em></h1>

    <div class="letter">
      <p>
        I read books, think too much, and write down the things that stay with me.
      </p>
      <p>
        Sometimes that's a sentence from a book. Sometimes it's a question about
        why people behave the way they do. Sometimes it's something I couldn't
        quite say to someone.
      </p>
      <p>This is where I put those things.</p>

      <h2>What I read</h2>
      <p>
        Write a few lines here: the genres you reach for, the books you return to,
        and the ones you almost abandoned.
      </p>

      <h2>What I write about</h2>
      <p>
        Write a few lines here: books as starting points, the strange things
        humans do, and the feelings that are hard to name.
      </p>

      <h2>Why this exists</h2>
      <p>
        Write a few lines here, in your own voice. This is the part readers
        remember.
      </p>

      <p class="handwritten sign">— with love, (your name)</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .column {
    width: min(100% - 3rem, var(--reading-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .page {
    padding-block: var(--space-5) 0;
  }
  h1 {
    margin-block: var(--space-1) var(--space-4);
  }
  .letter {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .letter p {
    margin-bottom: 1.4em;
  }
  .letter h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-3);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .sign {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--wine);
  }
</style>